# --- Raw data ---
# The pipeline reads exactly four files: movies_metadata.csv, keywords.csv,
# links_small.csv, ratings_small.csv (~41 MB total) — these ARE committed so a
# fresh clone can reproduce everything. The large unused files (ratings.csv
# ~677 MB, credits.csv ~181 MB, links.csv) are not versioned; provide them
# yourself if you want the full dataset.
data/raw/ratings.csv
data/raw/credits.csv
data/raw/links.csv

